# Several transfers across the standard dev accounts (section 14),
# then padding the chain forward with empty blocks and checking the
# resulting block height - a minimal stand-in for the "network activity
# over many blocks" scenarios described in section 79 (10/11).
#
# Run with:
#   web3emu scenario scenarios/multi_account_transfers.web3scenario

CREATE ACCOUNT Alice BALANCE 50000
CREATE ACCOUNT Bob BALANCE 50000
CREATE ACCOUNT Treasury BALANCE 500000
TRANSFER 5000 FROM Treasury TO Alice
TRANSFER 5000 FROM Treasury TO Bob
TRANSFER 1000 FROM Alice TO Bob
TRANSFER 500 FROM Bob TO Alice
MINE 20 BLOCKS
ASSERT BLOCK HEIGHT == 24
ASSERT Alice BALANCE >= 53000
ASSERT Bob BALANCE >= 53000
